    "preamble": "Gokul Prasad vs State Of U.P. on 16 September, 2019 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad, Lucknow Bench ?Court No. - 28 Case :- Criminal Revision No. - 566 of 2006 Revisionist :- Gokul Prasad Opposite Party :- State Of U.P. Counsel for Revisionist :- Bajrang Bahadur Singh Counsel for Opposite Party :- Govt.Advocate Hon'ble Virendra Kumar-II,J. The C.J.M., Sultanpur vide letter dated 14.09.2019 has reported that he has recorded statements of witnesses, daughter-in-law of the deceased, Gomti Devi, grand son-Rajan Kasodhan, process server S.I. GauravAwasthi and Village Head, Sanno, who have apprised that revisionist-Gokul Prasad has expired 3-4 years ago.",
